Initial fail-fast sweep reached the required formatter check and exited 1 only
because the new command-engine files had not yet been rustfmt-formatted. No
test or Clippy result was claimed from that incomplete run.

After `cargo fmt --all`, the focused GREEN was rerun and the final fail-fast
sweep passed:

- `cargo test -p topology-command-engine`: one integration test and doctests passed.
- `cargo test -p topology-device-registry`: exact, unknown-firmware, and metadata tests passed.
- `cargo fmt --all -- --check`: passed.
- `cargo clippy -p topology-command-engine --all-targets -- -D warnings`: passed with no warnings.
- scoped `git diff --check`: passed.
